  "title": "Consciousness is what being the entity is",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "313253b3-013a-4d7c-9d3a-d1539de1a105",
      "text": "Consciousness is not a property an entity has, a level it reaches or a threshold it crosses. The entity's constitutive activity, self-maintaining and genealogically individuated, is the consciousness, so an entity cannot exist without it.",
